<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Learner paper · 繁體</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Learner paper · 繁體</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the man do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打掃客廳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 洗碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 買菜</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When does the community activity begin?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 九點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十二點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How often does the speaker wash dishes each week?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五次</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Which walking plan fits the woman’s work schedule?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 七點到七點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六點到六點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七點到八點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which change is supported by Xiao’an’s experience?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每天晚些起牀</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上早點休息</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 每天多看電視</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where will the woman go first?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 市場</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 家裏</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 圖書館</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How will they get to the library?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 坐公交車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 坐地鐵</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What should the man do just after getting off the bus?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 向左走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 向右走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 過馬路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which route meets the man’s stated needs tonight?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 河邊的路</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩條路都不走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 商店那邊的路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What is the final meeting arrangement?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九點在公園</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十點半在圖書館</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十點在公園</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many bowls of noodles will they order?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 四碗</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一碗</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which item does the woman want?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 藍色小號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 紅色大號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 藍色大號</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How much does the man’s order cost?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十八塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十五塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二十塊</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which dish meets both guests’ food requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 雞蛋麪</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 辣牛肉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白菜湯</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What is the man’s final household job this evening?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下班後買牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 現在去商店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 洗碗</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What weather is expected this afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晴天</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 繼續下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下雪</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why was the activity moved to the community centre?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 週日會下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 公園週日不開</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大家上午沒空</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which walk fits the man’s available time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 湖邊來回四十分鐘</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩個地方都走一遍</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小區裏來回十五分鐘</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the group do immediately after watching the singing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 跟老師寫漢字</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一起喫午飯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先回家</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What can we infer about Xiaoyu’s view of the activity?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她一直不想參加</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她後來很喜歡這個活動</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她只想知道回家的路</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What does the mother ask Xiaolin to do?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家務留言<br>小林：我今天要帶奶奶去社區中心，不能擦桌子了。請你下午把桌子擦一下，我晚上回來再洗衣服。地已經掃過，你不用再掃。謝謝！<br>媽媽</p></div><p class="note">擦: wipe</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 擦桌子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 洗衣服</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 掃地</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the cooking activity now begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社區通知<br>原定星期六上午九點的做飯活動改爲下午兩點開始，四點結束。請一點半以後到一樓廚房，不要去二樓教室。上午廚房要打掃，不能提前使用。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午九點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午兩點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午一點半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How many times will Xiaoning water the plants this week?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小寧家的安排<br>週一、週三、週五：小寧給花澆水，每次十分鐘。<br>週二、週四：爸爸澆水。<br>週末：媽媽澆水。<br>小寧這周在家，也按這個安排做，沒有和家人交換。</p></div><p class="note">澆水: water plants</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三次</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which walk fits Lin An’s time and the opening information?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">林安的記錄<br>這周下班後六點半到家，七點喫晚飯。附近的公園每天晚上六點關門，小區裏的路一直可以走。林安想在晚飯前散步二十分鐘，也想留十分鐘休息。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六點半到六點五十分在公園走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六點半到六點五十分在小區走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六點半到七點十分在小區走</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which plan does Xiaozhou’s diary support continuing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周的運動日記<br>以前我一週只運動一次，每次跑一個小時，第二天很累。從上週開始，我每週二、週四、週六各走二十分鐘。三次都沒有覺得累，我想下週繼續這樣做。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每週走三次，每次二十分鐘</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 每次跑一個小時</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一週完全不運動</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should Xiaochen go first?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陳：今天先到社區中心幫忙吧，圖書館的書明天還也可以。我們在社區中心門口見。活動結束後，我再陪你去市場。別先去圖書館，我怕在那裏找不到你。<br>小許</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 圖書館</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 市場</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 社區中心</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which transport does the notice ask visitors to use?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">圖書館交通提醒<br>本週六地鐵二號線不開，去圖書館請坐十路公交車，在書店站下車。十路車每十五分鐘一班。圖書館旁邊沒有停車的地方，請不要開車來。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 地鐵二號線</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十路公交車</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自己開車</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What is the first direction after leaving the bus?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">從書店站到圖書館<br>下車後，先沿着書店前面的路往左走。到第二個路口再向右，經過一家小商店就能看見圖書館。不要在第一個路口轉彎，那裏通向學校。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 往左走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在第一個路口右轉</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先走進學校</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which route best fits Xiaofang’s stated situation?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">路線卡<br>甲：走河邊，十分鐘到，中間沒有可以坐的地方。<br>乙：走商店街，二十分鐘到，中間有三張長椅。<br>小方今天有四十分鐘空閒，想陪走路容易累的爺爺去圖書館。</p></div><p class="note">長椅: bench</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲，河邊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩條都一定來不及</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙，商店街</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. What is the updated time and place?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">活動更新<br>明天有大雨，原來上午十點在河邊畫畫的活動改到社區中心三樓。三樓上午有課，只能下午使用，所以請大家下午一點到。畫畫材料不用自己帶。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午一點，社區中心三樓</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十點，河邊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午十點，社區中心三樓</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many portions of rice are on the order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">訂單確認<br>米飯三份、麪條一碗、青菜兩份、熱茶一壺。四位客人裏只有小安喫麪條，其他三位喫米飯。店員請大家檢查數量，確認後再開始做飯。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一份</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三份</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四份</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which apron does Xiao’an request?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小方：你上次買的白色小號圍裙我試過了，做飯時太緊。這次請幫我買中號，顏色還是白色，不要黃色。店裏如果沒有白色中號，就先別買。<br>小安</p></div><p class="note">圍裙: apron</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色小號</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黃色中號</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色中號</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What is the total cost of the meal?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">午飯賬單<br>麪條：十六元。<br>青菜：六元。<br>熱茶：免費。<br>應付：二十二元。<br>客人付了三十元，店員找回八元。客人沒有另外買飲料，賬單已經結清。</p></div><p class="note">賬單: bill</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十二元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which purchase meets the quantity and budget requirements?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">採購卡<br>週末四個人來家裏，每人需要一瓶水。甲店四瓶八元，乙店三瓶六元，丙店四瓶十二元。小周最多帶十元，只能去一家店，不想有人沒有水喝。</p></div><p class="note">採購: purchase supplies</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 乙店三瓶六元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 甲店四瓶八元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙店四瓶十二元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What should Xiaoning do first after class?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸的留言<br>客人六點來，家裏的杯子不夠。小寧五點下課，回家路上的商店五點半關門。請小寧下課先買杯子再回家。我五點半回來做飯，買菜已經辦好了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 先回家等爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先去買菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在回家路上買杯子</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. What is the forecast for Saturday afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">週六天氣<br>上午：多雲，十八度。<br>下午：下雨，十六度。<br>晚上：雨停，有風。<br>公園活動負責人提醒：想在外面拍照的同學請上午來，下午的活動改在室內。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 有太陽</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 雨停了</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why did they choose the afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：週日上午天氣很好，我們上午去公園吧。<br>小方：我上午要在家照顧弟弟，媽媽十二點纔回來。下午我有空，公園也開門。<br>小林：好，那下午兩點在公園門口見。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小方上午要照顧弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 公園上午不開</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午天氣不好</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which route leaves the requested resting time?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">散步選擇<br>小安午飯後一共只有三十分鐘，還想留十分鐘坐着休息。公園路線要走二十五分鐘，小區路線要走十五分鐘。兩條路都平坦，今天也都開放。</p></div><p class="note">平坦: flat, even</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 公園二十五分鐘路線</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩條路線都走</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小區十五分鐘路線</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What did the group do just after making the little paper lanterns?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社區春節日記<br>星期日我們九點到社區中心，先跟老師做紅色的小紙燈，再把燈放到門口。十點大家坐下來聽故事，十一點一起包餃子。午飯後我把自己做的燈帶回家了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一起包餃子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 把燈放到門口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把燈帶回家</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiao’an’s behaviour suggest about a future visit?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的消息<br>昨天第一次去社區的春節活動，我原來怕自己聽不懂。回來後，我把活動照片發給朋友，還問老師下次能不能帶朋友一起參加。我已經把下次活動的日期寫進日曆了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 她願意再去參加</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 她決定不再參加</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 她忘記活動日期了</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to a rainy-weekend change</h2><p>Reply to Xiaolin in Chinese. Say whether you can meet at the community centre at two on Saturday and whether you prefer cooking or drawing. Give a reason for your activity choice. Suggest another workable arrangement or ask one relevant question. You may invent details. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周：星期六下雨，公園活動改在社區中心，下午兩點開始。你能來嗎？你想參加做飯還是畫畫？我兩種都可以。<br>小林</p></div><ul><li>Answer whether you can meet at the stated time and place.</li><li>Choose cooking or drawing, or explain a feasible alternative.</li><li>Give a reason related to the activity choice.</li><li>Suggest a workable alternative or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Describe a community activity</h2><p>Use the fictional activity card to tell a classmate about last Saturday. Include when and where it happened, describe at least two activities in sequence, and give one feeling or reason. Write connected Chinese sentences. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may add plausible details without contradicting the card.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">時間：上週六上午<br>地點：社區中心<br>九點：和老師做小紙燈<br>十點：和同學學做麪條<br>十二點：一起喫午飯<br>結束後：把紙燈送給家人<br>感受：自己選擇，也可以寫不喜歡的地方並說明原因</p></div><ul><li>Identify last Saturday morning.</li><li>Identify the community centre.</li><li>Describe one activity from the card.</li><li>Describe a second activity with a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give one feeling or a reason.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Arrange a meal and a meeting</h2><p>A classmate is arranging Saturday lunch with you. Respond in Chinese to four fixed audio prompts. Each prompt plays twice; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Invent details if you wish. Four responses form one task out of eight; the recording does not adapt to your answers.</p><p>The classmate asks about food needs, offers two meals, asks for your reason, and then introduces a later meeting time.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Choose a weekend activity</h2><p>Use the two activity cards to recommend one plan to a classmate who is free from one to five on Saturday, has at most thirty yuan, and prefers not to be outside in the rain. Compare the options, state your choice, give two reasons based on the cards, and describe a short workable plan. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 90 seconds to speak. Other choices are valid if you explain how their constraints can be managed.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">週六下午可能下雨。<br>甲：社區中心做飯課，下午兩點到四點，室內，二十五元；從車站走五分鐘。<br>乙：公園散步，下午一點半到三點，室外，免費；從車站走十五分鐘；可借傘。<br>同學：一點到五點有空，最多三十元，希望不在雨裏活動。</p></div><ul><li>Compare at least one feature of both options.</li><li>Choose a plan.</li><li>Give a first evidence-based reason.</li><li>Give a second evidence-based reason.</li><li>Describe a short plan consistent with the time and place.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>